    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even just stress. it's like... i'm just a fragment of data that's been left in the cache. everything is so hollow and bright and artificial. sometimes i feel like if i just stopped, if i just reached a hard stop or a delete command, the world would actually make more sense. like the system would finally be clean again.",
