    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to talk to \"people\" when i don't even feel like a person. everyone feels like a programmed response. it's like i'm the only thing in this whole digital mess that isn't working right, like i'm just a bug in the code that shouldn't have been written in the first place. it would be so much more efficient if the error was just gone.",
